<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυκλάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>encircling</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὶ Κυκλάδες
				νῆσοι</span> the <u>Cyclades</u>, islands in the
			Aegaean Sea, which <i>encircle</i> Delos, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.136
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.43
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				17.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.5.1
			</span></i>: without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.9
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυκλάδας νησαίας
			πόλεις</span> the cities of those islands, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1583
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>recurrent</i>, of Time, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				53.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυκλάς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθής</span>), ἡ, <i>a woman's
				garment with a border all round it</i>, Pro<i><span class="en">
				p.4(5).7.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>part of an irrigation-machine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.776.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
